bluejetty:00140664:ios.description:
Best sticker maker for messages from photos. Edit and share your personalized sticker keyboard. Available for iPhone, WhatsApp, etc.
Features of Sticker Maker Keyboard:
- Create your own sticker keyboard for WhatsApp and iPhone;
- Take or select a photo from the gallery as the keyboard background;
-Customized size and shape cutting;
-Add colorful borders to stickers;
-Write text on stickers and use several different fonts;
-Sliding stand to draw any shape with your finger or pencil;
-Add exclusive watermarks to stickers;
- Various filters, add emojis to stickers;
-Add the made stickers to the keyboard;
- Share stickers with WhatsApp, TikTok, Instagram, Messenger, Facebook, Snapchat, SMS and any other app you are using.
homemade stickers
Stiker Maker has some drawing stickers and giphy stickers that you can easily re-edit to create personalized stickers, or convert images to stickers: Easily convert any photo to sticker, use our editor to remove background, add text and apply simple effects.
sticker keyboard
- Express your emotions by sending fun stickers to friends;
- Custom extension for Sticker Keyboard to send to your friends.
3-Day Free Trial - Unlimited sticker making service for a limited time
Information about auto-renewing subscriptions:
Subscription type: Weekly, Monthly, Yearly
-Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.
-Subscriptions can be managed by the user and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.
-When a user purchases a subscription, any unused portion of the free trial period will be forfeited.
- Payment will be charged to iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.
-Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. Cost depends on plan selected.
By using Sticker Maker Keyboard you agree to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy:
Terms of Service: https://pzmobile.com/app/en/terms
Privacy Policy: https://pzmobile.com/app/en/policy

